{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55763","headline":"赠实师伯 · 义存","name":"赠实师伯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"善哉道者，顿息大机。\n堂堂密密，将何显伊？\n千山绝顶，万重绿衣。\n风云抱合，我终不知。\n以此浮幻，随处徉痴。\n严霜欲至，放发齐眉。\n僧俗不辩，怀量任疑。\n晓我微功，雨势云飞。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"义存","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55763.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55763","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}